{
  "version": "2026-04-24",
  "name": "feishu_interactive_02_dispatch_rich",
  "description": "rich 版 02 派单。用于复杂派单：摘要卡 + annex 入口。",
  "message_type": "dispatch",
  "message_code": "02",
  "label": "派单",
  "detail_level": "rich",
  "msg_type": "interactive",
  "card": {
    "config": {
      "wide_screen_mode": true,
      "enable_forward": true
    },
    "header": {
      "template": "blue",
      "title": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "{title_prefix}｜02 派单"
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "rich 执行单 · {task_name}"
      }
    },
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**✦ 执行单概览**\n任务名称｜{task_name}\n主接单｜{owner_mention}\n协作知会｜{collaborator_mentions}\n收口抄送｜{closer_mentions}\n执行目标｜{goal}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**◈ 执行清单**\n- ☐ {deliverable_1}\n- ☐ {deliverable_2}\n- ☐ {deliverable_3}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**◔ 时间节点**\n进展回报｜{progress_deadline}\n结果交付｜{delivery_deadline}\n当前状态｜{status}\n下一节点｜{next_milestone}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**☰ Annex 附录**\n附录标题｜{annex_title}\n附录摘要｜{annex_summary}\n附录链接｜{annex_link}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**⊘ 禁止项**\n{guardrails_md}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**receipt｜**以回读与 mention 验证为准。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "default_values": {
    "collaborator_mentions": "-",
    "closer_mentions": "Hermes_CEO",
    "annex_title": "详细执行附录",
    "annex_summary": "详见附录中的全量背景、字段、验收口径与依赖说明"
  },
  "business_sections": {
    "guardrails": {
      "render_key": "guardrails_md",
      "legacy_prefix": "guardrail_",
      "required": true,
      "max_items": 3
    }
  },
  "required_placeholders": [
    "title_prefix",
    "task_name",
    "owner_mention",
    "goal",
    "deliverable_1",
    "deliverable_2",
    "deliverable_3",
    "progress_deadline",
    "delivery_deadline",
    "status",
    "next_milestone",
    "annex_link",
    "guardrails_md"
  ]
}
